  message: "Leaf WI-molit closed WONT_DO 2026-07-17 (fundamental-concept-audit KEEP verdict, owner-directed 3-lens audit). The ast_call vs ast_call_direct 'redundantly encodes is_resolved' premise does NOT hold: they are distinct call-CONSTRUCT pathways (ADR-0028 explicitly accepts ast_call_direct as a pure pathway); resolution is separate on Edge.is_resolved (ADR-0037); the 98.5%/8.3% split is a benign common-cause correlation; ZERO consumers use the label as a resolution proxy. Added the reusable META-bifif property tests (evidence_type⊥is_resolved). This parent's own statement ('no resolution-state smuggled INTO THE LABEL') is SATISFIED — its real leaks (ast_call_method fold, default-leak) already closed. See ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept-audit-evidence_type_is_resolved_07172026.md."  # e2b4
